OL,3,GNEWSASouth East prepares for impact of
OL,4,AStorm Austen
OL,5,
OL,6,FSeafront closures, cancelled events and
OL,7,Ftravel disruption are expected as the
OL,8,Ffirst named storm of the season
OL,9,Fapproaches south-east England.
OL,11,FThe Met Office has issued a yellow
OL,12,Fweather warning for wind across the
OL,13,Fregion, with gusts of up to 70mph
OL,14,F(113km/h) forecast on Friday.
OL,16,FIn East Sussex, sections of Eastbourne
OL,17,Fseafront promenade will close because
OL,18,Fof concerns about large waves and
OL,19,Fstrong winds.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,330,320,200,140,0,100
